(3891624, 552742, 39675, '<td valign="top">Very good photograph.  I like the  backlight, shallow depth of field, and choice of dress (color and dots).  Model is beautiful and projects a natural joy.</td>', 'Very good photograph.  I like the  backlight, shallow depth of field, and choice of dress (color and dots).  Model is beautiful and projects a natural joy.', '2007-07-11 01:41:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(3891651, 551182, 39675, '<td valign="top">I hope other voters don''t pass this one by without noticing how great this photograph is.  The depth of field is perfect.  Love the interaction of the groom with the gentleman sitting down.  the brides expression is not about poising or trying to look a certain way, it is all about the joy she feels.  Great. 10.</td>', 'I hope other voters don''t pass this one by without noticing how great this photograph is.  The depth of field is perfect.  Love the interaction of the groom with the gentleman sitting down.  the brides expression is not about poising or trying to look a certain way, it is all about the joy she feels.  Great. 10.', '2007-07-11 01:44:54.000000', NULL, 1),
