(3892396, 551982, 66201, '<td valign="top">A LOT of noise in this image and background clutter is distracting.Such a weird and wonderful image though... with a great angle.  "Neat Image" would easily smooth out all that noise:-)</td>', 'A LOT of noise in this image and background clutter is distracting.Such a weird and wonderful image though... with a great angle.  "Neat Image" would easily smooth out all that noise:-)', '2007-07-11 08:33:48.000000', NULL, 1),
