(3894625, 552977, 72200, '<td valign="top">Perfect 10. Most of the photos in the contest had little or nothing to do with the challenge...except tying ''dream'' into the name ("I dream of trees", "I dream of water","I dream of bugs on flowers","I coincidentally dream of fireworks around the Fourth of July", etc...) Something creative like this is what I believe they had in mind when they came up with the challenge.</td>', 'Perfect 10. Most of the photos in the contest had little or nothing to do with the challenge...except tying ''dream'' into the name ("I dream of trees", "I dream of water","I dream of bugs on flowers","I coincidentally dream of fireworks around the Fourth of July", etc...) Something creative like this is what I believe they had in mind when they came up with the challenge.', '2007-07-11 17:21:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(3894627, 552245, 67258, '<td valign="top">A definite xxscarletxx influence here in the tea-table set-up. I do like the idea of the formal set-up out in the wilderness - one that will always appeal to me, and the sort of scene I can imagine creeping in to my dreams.  The almost cartoon like clouds further the dream theme.  Nice one.</td>', 'A definite xxscarletxx influence here in the tea-table set-up. I do like the idea of the formal set-up out in the wilderness - one that will always appeal to me, and the sort of scene I can imagine creeping in to my dreams.  The almost cartoon like clouds further the dream theme.  Nice one.', '2007-07-11 17:21:24.000000', NULL, 1),
