(3900561, 551820, 70000, '<td valign="top">OH MY GOSH....OH MY GOSH!!!!! The detail in the cats fir is just wonderful and this is soooo cute, reminds me of this shot: <a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=449382" rel="nofollow" target="_blank"><img alt="'' . substr(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/70000/thumb/449382.jpg'', strrpos(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/70000/thumb/449382.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/70000/thumb/449382.jpg"/></a> oh how freaking cute....</td>', 'OH MY GOSH....OH MY GOSH!!!!! The detail in the cats fir is just wonderful and this is soooo cute, reminds me of this shot:  oh how freaking cute....', '2007-07-13 13:29:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(3900590, 552871, 24454, '<td valign="top">Dreams about to come true :)  Beautiful photo of a beautiful time!</td>', 'Dreams about to come true :)  Beautiful photo of a beautiful time!', '2007-07-13 13:42:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(3900593, 552757, 24454, '<td valign="top">A dream come true, both in the happy occasion, and in having such a beautiful wedding photo!  Love truly oozes from this photo.</td>', 'A dream come true, both in the happy occasion, and in having such a beautiful wedding photo!  Love truly oozes from this photo.', '2007-07-13 13:43:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(3900601, 549885, 24454, '<td valign="top">OMG.. . I know I will be dreaming of this place tonight!   I will discipline myself not to include the jealousy factor in my vote  :)  <br/> <br/>Truly a stunning picture -- its hard to believe there are really places on this earth that spectacular!</td>', 'OMG.. . I know I will be dreaming of this place tonight!   I will discipline myself not to include the jealousy factor in my vote  :)   Truly a stunning picture -- its hard to believe there are really places on this earth that spectacular!', '2007-07-13 13:46:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(3900609, 552977, 24454, '<td valign="top">How pretty.  I bet she had so much fun being in this picture.   She looks like such the beautiful, dreamy princess.</td>', 'How pretty.  I bet she had so much fun being in this picture.   She looks like such the beautiful, dreamy princess.', '2007-07-13 13:48:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(3900614, 552766, 24454, '<td valign="top">I love photos like this.  What a beautiful reflection.   The concep works great for dreams.</td>', 'I love photos like this.  What a beautiful reflection.   The concep works great for dreams.', '2007-07-13 13:50:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(3900618, 550119, 24454, '<td valign="top">I do really like the way you''ve processed this to add a dreaminess effect.  And what a lovely scene.   It makes my heart long to be in a place like that right now.</td>', 'I do really like the way you''ve processed this to add a dreaminess effect.  And what a lovely scene.   It makes my heart long to be in a place like that right now.', '2007-07-13 13:51:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(3900621, 550476, 24454, '<td valign="top">How pretty!  Striking for a dream scene.  Very well done.</td>', 'How pretty!  Striking for a dream scene.  Very well done.', '2007-07-13 13:52:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(3900627, 551429, 24454, '<td valign="top">What a creative concept.  Conveyed beautifully.  Well done!!!</td>', 'What a creative concept.  Conveyed beautifully.  Well done!!!', '2007-07-13 13:54:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(3900655, 552673, 24454, '<td valign="top">Awww. . .and my prayer is that your dream will come true!</td>', 'Awww. . .and my prayer is that your dream will come true!', '2007-07-13 14:07:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(3900660, 552764, 24454, '<td valign="top">This is a perfect concept for a dream photo!  I love how you''ve composed it.   This photo would be so kick-butt if it had been taken at sunrise or sunset when the lighting was a little more subdued.   But I do really like it like it is too.</td>', 'This is a perfect concept for a dream photo!  I love how you''ve composed it.   This photo would be so kick-butt if it had been taken at sunrise or sunset when the lighting was a little more subdued.   But I do really like it like it is too.', '2007-07-13 14:09:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(3900672, 552801, 24454, '<td valign="top">It makes me smile imagining the actual set up for this wonderful photo.  I bet it was lots of fun.   The photo is impressive and creative and beautifully composed.</td>', 'It makes me smile imagining the actual set up for this wonderful photo.  I bet it was lots of fun.   The photo is impressive and creative and beautifully composed.', '2007-07-13 14:13:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(3900677, 552746, 24454, '<td valign="top">Awwwww. . ..and that unfulfilled longing could also fall under the nightmare category too, huh?   There''s nothing quite so sad.   <br/> <br/>This is a great concept for this challenge.   And I like the processing for a dream scene.</td>', 'Awwwww. . ..and that unfulfilled longing could also fall under the nightmare category too, huh?   There''s nothing quite so sad.    This is a great concept for this challenge.   And I like the processing for a dream scene.', '2007-07-13 14:15:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(3900897, 552735, 56828, '<td valign="top">I like this shot and I like the idea...but you could have used more room at the top of the photo in the sky area...maybe a slightly more zoomed out version.  As it is now, it looks like you clipped off the top.</td>', 'I like this shot and I like the idea...but you could have used more room at the top of the photo in the sky area...maybe a slightly more zoomed out version.  As it is now, it looks like you clipped off the top.', '2007-07-13 15:52:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(3900899, 552742, 56828, '<td valign="top">I like how you used the overexposure to your advantage.  I think it really adds to the dream state of the photo.  Great ph oto.  My only complaint would be the lens glare you have righ tin the center of her stomach.</td>', 'I like how you used the overexposure to your advantage.  I think it really adds to the dream state of the photo.  Great ph oto.  My only complaint would be the lens glare you have righ tin the center of her stomach.', '2007-07-13 15:54:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(3900903, 551115, 56828, '<td valign="top">I think this is an amazing photo.  My only complaint would be to crop out the left side a little more to rid of part of the panel.</td>', 'I think this is an amazing photo.  My only complaint would be to crop out the left side a little more to rid of part of the panel.', '2007-07-13 15:55:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(3900915, 552664, 56828, '<td valign="top">I don''t quite get the title, but i do like the photo.</td>', 'I don''t quite get the title, but i do like the photo.', '2007-07-13 15:58:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(3900919, 552925, 56828, '<td valign="top">Great color scheme.  Nice DOF.</td>', 'Great color scheme.  Nice DOF.', '2007-07-13 15:59:38.000000', NULL, 1),
