(3901046, 552007, 68256, '<td valign="top">Although busy and confusing it all seems to work together to set the mood of the photo. 6</td>', 'Although busy and confusing it all seems to work together to set the mood of the photo. 6', '2007-07-13 16:56:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(3901051, 549885, 68256, '<td valign="top">I love the depth, but I wish there was a little more contrast and I would have prefered warm tones instead of cool....  Composition is excellent and good working controlling the exposure.  8</td>', 'I love the depth, but I wish there was a little more contrast and I would have prefered warm tones instead of cool....  Composition is excellent and good working controlling the exposure.  8', '2007-07-13 16:58:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(3901055, 551583, 68256, '<td valign="top">The composition is a little too static for me (maybe move her  little right?)  Something that might have helped the composition would have been to have the model extend har right arm out to create a stark diagonal line going to the corner.  Overall nice photo though.  7</td>', 'The composition is a little too static for me (maybe move her  little right?)  Something that might have helped the composition would have been to have the model extend har right arm out to create a stark diagonal line going to the corner.  Overall nice photo though.  7', '2007-07-13 17:00:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(3901061, 550476, 68256, '<td valign="top">Very dreamy...well done. The "stuff" on the edge of the water looks like trash though?  This would have been really great (for my personal taste) with warm tones instead of cool...6</td>', 'Very dreamy...well done. The "stuff" on the edge of the water looks like trash though?  This would have been really great (for my personal taste) with warm tones instead of cool...6', '2007-07-13 17:01:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(3901063, 552948, 68256, '<td valign="top">That is the most bizare composition that I''ve ever seen..I can''t believe I actually like it.  8</td>', 'That is the most bizare composition that I''ve ever seen..I can''t believe I actually like it.  8', '2007-07-13 17:02:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(3901073, 548770, 68256, '<td valign="top">Good use of perspective and subject matter.  I''m not sure why this photo doesn''t just grab me though.  Maybe it is the blown out sky or mixed color tones.  The composition is fine and good clarity.  I hate to give you a bad score and not be able to explain why. I''m giving it a 6.  I hope someone else is able to comment better.</td>', 'Good use of perspective and subject matter.  I''m not sure why this photo doesn''t just grab me though.  Maybe it is the blown out sky or mixed color tones.  The composition is fine and good clarity.  I hate to give you a bad score and not be able to explain why. I''m giving it a 6.  I hope someone else is able to comment better.', '2007-07-13 17:06:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(3901075, 552742, 68256, '<td valign="top">very nice high key photo.  Just a couple of constructive thoughts from someone who doesn''t really know anything....I don''t mind the blown sky, but I would have liked to been able to see the flower in her right hand.  The bleeding of harsh light onto her face is distracting.  I would like to have seen more space in front of her (crop closer on the right) for her to gaze into....and maybe a little more space overall around her.<br/> <br/>The photo has great impact though and negates a lot of those nitpicky things above....8</td>', 'very nice high key photo.  Just a couple of constructive thoughts from someone who doesn''t really know anything....I don''t mind the blown sky, but I would have liked to been able to see the flower in her right hand.  The bleeding of harsh light onto her face is distracting.  I would like to have seen more space in front of her (crop closer on the right) for her to gaze into....and maybe a little more space overall around her. The photo has great impact though and negates a lot of those nitpicky things above....8', '2007-07-13 17:09:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(3901078, 551108, 68256, '<td valign="top">Great timing and focus...I wished there were a little more sense of motion however.  Also, if the dog was facing the camera it would have been a better composition. 6</td>', 'Great timing and focus...I wished there were a little more sense of motion however.  Also, if the dog was facing the camera it would have been a better composition. 6', '2007-07-13 17:10:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(3901083, 552427, 68256, '<td valign="top">I like the "softness" of the pony, but the lighting seems very flat and the composition not really exciting.  The fence is also a little distracting.  I think a really shallow DOF and a tighter crop would have made the pony stand out better.  5</td>', 'I like the "softness" of the pony, but the lighting seems very flat and the composition not really exciting.  The fence is also a little distracting.  I think a really shallow DOF and a tighter crop would have made the pony stand out better.  5', '2007-07-13 17:14:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(3901085, 552636, 68256, '<td valign="top">Very interesting photo.  I like how the ice? points out into the sea.  I think some additional contrast (with a tone curve perhaps?) would have helped it out.  Great control over the exposer though with all that bright light.</td>', 'Very interesting photo.  I like how the ice? points out into the sea.  I think some additional contrast (with a tone curve perhaps?) would have helped it out.  Great control over the exposer though with all that bright light.', '2007-07-13 17:15:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(3901091, 552659, 68256, '<td valign="top">I would love to be able to see what is in the background. I realize that is the point of the photo, but just a little light maybe?  I think in order for this to work the picnic area would have had to had been very sharp and off centered...</td>', 'I would love to be able to see what is in the background. I realize that is the point of the photo, but just a little light maybe?  I think in order for this to work the picnic area would have had to had been very sharp and off centered...', '2007-07-13 17:18:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(3901166, 550088, 68256, '<td valign="top">Very interesting!  I though it was a stork that delivered new children?</td>', 'Very interesting!  I though it was a stork that delivered new children?', '2007-07-13 17:59:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(3901541, 551701, 68510, '<td valign="top">crazy bokeh!!</td>', 'crazy bokeh!!', '2007-07-13 19:49:11.000000', NULL, 1),
