(3901927, 552836, 42254, '<td valign="top">Beautiful--a fine shot illustrating the rule of thirds. I would probably cropped a bit more off the right &amp; top to get closer to the girl, but the desired impact is there with your version. I like the simplicity of this shot with a small blast of vibrant color &amp; attractive human subject. Nice job!</td>', 'Beautiful--a fine shot illustrating the rule of thirds. I would probably cropped a bit more off the right & top to get closer to the girl, but the desired impact is there with your version. I like the simplicity of this shot with a small blast of vibrant color & attractive human subject. Nice job!', '2007-07-13 22:32:24.000000', NULL, 1),
