(3902874, 550047, 77196, '<td valign="top">''67 ''Cuda Convertible - nice, very nice. I think your crop, cutting off the lights/bumper on either side, and so close at bottom &amp; top hurts this photo. If you''re going to do the whole car, it needs some space around it. If you''re going to do partial car, you could crop just to the right of the license and just at the convertible top, leaving the flag reflection in the car, but losing the actual flag.</td>', '''67 ''Cuda Convertible - nice, very nice. I think your crop, cutting off the lights/bumper on either side, and so close at bottom & top hurts this photo. If you''re going to do the whole car, it needs some space around it. If you''re going to do partial car, you could crop just to the right of the license and just at the convertible top, leaving the flag reflection in the car, but losing the actual flag.', '2007-07-14 13:15:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(3902904, 551579, 77196, '<td valign="top">Such a little thing makes a huge difference. I was about to rate this about a 4 until I noticed the reflection. It is easy to criticize this from many angles - it breaks many "rules". You''ve cut the face of the person in the foreground (incidentally, about the only part of the picture in focus) in half. My only comment is that it may be too easy to miss the young man''s reflection in the window, and thus miss the entire shot. It is a great image, and works well in b&amp;w. Excellent work - hope you don''t get graded down because people don''t really see what is there.</td>', 'Such a little thing makes a huge difference. I was about to rate this about a 4 until I noticed the reflection. It is easy to criticize this from many angles - it breaks many "rules". You''ve cut the face of the person in the foreground (incidentally, about the only part of the picture in focus) in half. My only comment is that it may be too easy to miss the young man''s reflection in the window, and thus miss the entire shot. It is a great image, and works well in b&w. Excellent work - hope you don''t get graded down because people don''t really see what is there.', '2007-07-14 13:30:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(3902919, 551583, 42254, '<td valign="top">Not bad--pretty sky &amp; silhouette, but I think it would be more effective with model in the left third, a bit farther away, and looking toward the beautiful clouds above and to the right.</td>', 'Not bad--pretty sky & silhouette, but I think it would be more effective with model in the left third, a bit farther away, and looking toward the beautiful clouds above and to the right.', '2007-07-14 13:35:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(3902920, 552440, 42254, '<td valign="top">Unusual &amp; striking!</td>', 'Unusual & striking!', '2007-07-14 13:35:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(3902925, 551579, 42254, '<td valign="top">You captured the dream essence--could be simple, dreamy reflection of gal behind the old woman or, it could reflect the ethereal dream of the woman--when she was young, her granddaughter, etc.  Very effective &amp; B&amp;W &amp; perfect exposure.  This one should take a ribbon.</td>', 'You captured the dream essence--could be simple, dreamy reflection of gal behind the old woman or, it could reflect the ethereal dream of the woman--when she was young, her granddaughter, etc.  Very effective & B&W & perfect exposure.  This one should take a ribbon.', '2007-07-14 13:36:51.000000', NULL, 1),
