(3902937, 552146, 77196, '<td valign="top">The bird is almost totally hidden by the background &amp; its shadows. The rest of the picture is unappealing, except for the great patterns &amp; framing (light posts &amp; iron framework) - but the center of the patterns / framing is basically empty blue sky. I suspect this was a much nicer shot before being reduced for the web.</td>', 'The bird is almost totally hidden by the background & its shadows. The rest of the picture is unappealing, except for the great patterns & framing (light posts & iron framework) - but the center of the patterns / framing is basically empty blue sky. I suspect this was a much nicer shot before being reduced for the web.', '2007-07-14 13:43:17.000000', NULL, 1),
