(3903322, 552761, 42254, '<td valign="top">I like the "filmy" stuff for it''s dreamy effect but not sure how the cage(?)adds to the photo.  I find myself focusing on it trying to figure out waht it is there for (perhaps tiny fish inside--can''t tell)instead of enjoying the beauty &amp; mood.</td>', 'I like the "filmy" stuff for it''s dreamy effect but not sure how the cage(?)adds to the photo.  I find myself focusing on it trying to figure out waht it is there for (perhaps tiny fish inside--can''t tell)instead of enjoying the beauty & mood.', '2007-07-14 15:47:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(3903324, 548949, 74605, '<td valign="top">Aw, sweet.  I like the idea of this.  Good work.</td>', 'Aw, sweet.  I like the idea of this.  Good work.', '2007-07-14 15:47:40.000000', NULL, 1),
