(3903360, 550863, 42254, '<td valign="top">Clever idea and well executed with quite sharp eyes and colorful worms.  The person (child)is focusing up close which completes the effect.  (Personally I''d rather have the Haribo Raspberries!  Great shot--perhaps too many reflections, but not terribly distracting.</td>', 'Clever idea and well executed with quite sharp eyes and colorful worms.  The person (child)is focusing up close which completes the effect.  (Personally I''d rather have the Haribo Raspberries!  Great shot--perhaps too many reflections, but not terribly distracting.', '2007-07-14 15:57:19.000000', NULL, 1),
