(3903371, 552977, 42254, '<td valign="top">Clever idea that is well executed &amp; beautifully photographed. Fits the theme well.  Were you flying yourself??  Have you tried it with a little less highlight above and left of her head--perhaps a little on her face?</td>', 'Clever idea that is well executed & beautifully photographed. Fits the theme well.  Were you flying yourself??  Have you tried it with a little less highlight above and left of her head--perhaps a little on her face?', '2007-07-14 16:00:06.000000', NULL, 1),
