(3903377, 552681, 42254, '<td valign="top">High grain &amp; hint of a figure in the background emphasize the ethereal mood. Great shot &amp; expression on the boy.  The whole thing fits the category very well.  Nice job!</td>', 'High grain & hint of a figure in the background emphasize the ethereal mood. Great shot & expression on the boy.  The whole thing fits the category very well.  Nice job!', '2007-07-14 16:04:28.000000', NULL, 1),
