(3903453, 551982, 76430, '<td valign="top">I love the expression.  Good fisheye shot.  The stones are a bit out of focus.  Looking at the title it does look a little like Gollum/Smeagol but much cuter.</td>', 'I love the expression.  Good fisheye shot.  The stones are a bit out of focus.  Looking at the title it does look a little like Gollum/Smeagol but much cuter.', '2007-07-14 17:07:15.000000', NULL, 1),
