(3908932, 549339, 47316, '<td valign="top">crazy! This could have really popped with a bit more editing... up the saturation a bit and fiddle with shadows/highlights.<br/> <br/>I think it would have been cool to cu the groun out completely... or have a little more, the amount in the shot now is just not looking good to me.</td>', 'crazy! This could have really popped with a bit more editing... up the saturation a bit and fiddle with shadows/highlights. I think it would have been cool to cu the groun out completely... or have a little more, the amount in the shot now is just not looking good to me.', '2007-07-16 19:42:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(3908933, 552902, 47316, '<td valign="top">Very nice subject! The composition I think could do with being a little more square, my eye doesn''t know where to look, the mountain or the trees. Perhaps you could have squatted down lower and see what the mountian would look like between the trees?</td>', 'Very nice subject! The composition I think could do with being a little more square, my eye doesn''t know where to look, the mountain or the trees. Perhaps you could have squatted down lower and see what the mountian would look like between the trees?', '2007-07-16 19:44:22.000000', NULL, 1),
