(3908944, 552761, 47316, '<td valign="top">Strange! It''s a really cool concept but the shot could have used a lot of work. Def need some emotion from the model, I''m sure it was hard to do underwater but there might be more impact if we could see more of her, especiall her face.</td>', 'Strange! It''s a really cool concept but the shot could have used a lot of work. Def need some emotion from the model, I''m sure it was hard to do underwater but there might be more impact if we could see more of her, especiall her face.', '2007-07-16 19:47:20.000000', NULL, 1),
