(3909163, 551634, 76430, '<td valign="top">Claire?  Cute outfit.  You came up with a lot of Alice in Wonderland things for this with the clothing, cards, chess board.  Very well composed, colored and lit.  9</td>', 'Claire?  Cute outfit.  You came up with a lot of Alice in Wonderland things for this with the clothing, cards, chess board.  Very well composed, colored and lit.  9', '2007-07-16 21:49:54.000000', NULL, 1),
