(3909527, 548848, 15511, '<td valign="top">I had that dream. There''s noise in the sky. Nice capture.</td>', 'I had that dream. There''s noise in the sky. Nice capture.', '2007-07-17 00:05:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(3909539, 552509, 15511, '<td valign="top">I like the serendipity of the clouds. I love ships. Image appears over-sharpened, else, nice photo.</td>', 'I like the serendipity of the clouds. I love ships. Image appears over-sharpened, else, nice photo.', '2007-07-17 00:09:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(3909548, 550517, 15511, '<td valign="top">The odd colors are a disconnect, the border is less helpful. I think more background would also help.</td>', 'The odd colors are a disconnect, the border is less helpful. I think more background would also help.', '2007-07-17 00:14:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(3909558, 550491, 76430, '<td valign="top">At first look I thought this was a ski slope.  Nice cloud pattern that we don''t normally get this time of year in southern California.  Is it right side up?</td>', 'At first look I thought this was a ski slope.  Nice cloud pattern that we don''t normally get this time of year in southern California.  Is it right side up?', '2007-07-17 00:19:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(3909562, 552746, 76430, '<td valign="top">The sharp focus on the hand but soft focus on the face along with the B/W emphasizes the title of not having a baby.</td>', 'The sharp focus on the hand but soft focus on the face along with the B/W emphasizes the title of not having a baby.', '2007-07-17 00:22:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(3909606, 551429, 54632, '<td valign="top">B&amp;W, Poetic, nice!</td>', 'B&W, Poetic, nice!', '2007-07-17 00:40:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(3909608, 552836, 54632, '<td valign="top">Looks like a professional finish! Nice colour.</td>', 'Looks like a professional finish! Nice colour.', '2007-07-17 00:41:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(3909629, 552102, 50695, '<td valign="top">keep dreaming!</td>', 'keep dreaming!', '2007-07-17 00:53:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(3909711, 549393, 76430, '<td valign="top">Beautiful scene.  I think it would have been improved if you had dropped down a bit and moved in and gotten rid of the widow with bars on it on top, making the window a frame for your picture.  Where is this, Pebble Beach?</td>', 'Beautiful scene.  I think it would have been improved if you had dropped down a bit and moved in and gotten rid of the widow with bars on it on top, making the window a frame for your picture.  Where is this, Pebble Beach?', '2007-07-17 01:27:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(3909727, 551619, 76430, '<td valign="top">I''m going to have to say that the only thing going for this picture is the markings on the car.  I think it would have been greatly improved if you had moved in to make the markings almost the entire picture making them clearer, gotten rid of the dark reflections, and had only enough car in it to identify it as a car, whether it''s the corner of the wheel well or the side mirror.  I''ll have to give it a 4.</td>', 'I''m going to have to say that the only thing going for this picture is the markings on the car.  I think it would have been greatly improved if you had moved in to make the markings almost the entire picture making them clearer, gotten rid of the dark reflections, and had only enough car in it to identify it as a car, whether it''s the corner of the wheel well or the side mirror.  I''ll have to give it a 4.', '2007-07-17 01:33:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(3909736, 552802, 76430, '<td valign="top">This poor guy/gal needs a horse hood!  I''m not sure what kind of dream this is, but it looks like it meets the nightmare challenge better.</td>', 'This poor guy/gal needs a horse hood!  I''m not sure what kind of dream this is, but it looks like it meets the nightmare challenge better.', '2007-07-17 01:37:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(3909747, 550671, 76430, '<td valign="top">Nice indirection of observing the artist. Also a triple entendre dream ^3.</td>', 'Nice indirection of observing the artist. Also a triple entendre dream ^3.', '2007-07-17 01:42:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(3909782, 551589, 76430, '<td valign="top">Really nice foreground.  Is the glass sitting on a table?  I like the drops on the glass and the clarity of the background through the glass.  The actual background is a bit bright and not very sharp.  The biggest problem though is it all appears to be slanted to the right.</td>', 'Really nice foreground.  Is the glass sitting on a table?  I like the drops on the glass and the clarity of the background through the glass.  The actual background is a bit bright and not very sharp.  The biggest problem though is it all appears to be slanted to the right.', '2007-07-17 02:04:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(3909906, 551031, 55494, '<td valign="top">Looks a little too overexposed for me. Also, I''d try shooting from a slightly different angle next time (maybe from higher up so that the eyes are a bigger part of the photo).</td>', 'Looks a little too overexposed for me. Also, I''d try shooting from a slightly different angle next time (maybe from higher up so that the eyes are a bigger part of the photo).', '2007-07-17 04:48:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(3909907, 552755, 55494, '<td valign="top">I really like the soft focus effect in this photo. Nice composition too!</td>', 'I really like the soft focus effect in this photo. Nice composition too!', '2007-07-17 04:50:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(3909908, 550476, 55494, '<td valign="top">Wow, very cool shot! I love the soft green light filtering through the trees, it really does look dreamlike.</td>', 'Wow, very cool shot! I love the soft green light filtering through the trees, it really does look dreamlike.', '2007-07-17 04:51:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(3909911, 552480, 55494, '<td valign="top">It looks like the color of this is a little off (specifically, the dog/ground has a pink color cast, and the grass doesn''t really look very green). Also, the dog''s head looks a little too centered (at least for me personally). Maybe cropping off a little more of the left side would help?</td>', 'It looks like the color of this is a little off (specifically, the dog/ground has a pink color cast, and the grass doesn''t really look very green). Also, the dog''s head looks a little too centered (at least for me personally). Maybe cropping off a little more of the left side would help?', '2007-07-17 04:54:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(3909913, 552977, 55494, '<td valign="top">Very nice picture! I love the girl''s dress flowing around her like an angel combined with the soft white light that the cloth seems to radiate.</td>', 'Very nice picture! I love the girl''s dress flowing around her like an angel combined with the soft white light that the cloth seems to radiate.', '2007-07-17 04:55:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(3909914, 549340, 55494, '<td valign="top">Cool idea. Shouldn''t the hand be holding a paintbrush though? ;-)  Still, I like the photo as is!</td>', 'Cool idea. Shouldn''t the hand be holding a paintbrush though? ;-)  Still, I like the photo as is!', '2007-07-17 04:57:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(3909916, 552925, 55494, '<td valign="top">Good focus and partial desaturation, I think it works well in this photo!</td>', 'Good focus and partial desaturation, I think it works well in this photo!', '2007-07-17 04:58:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(3910034, 552977, 43869, '<td valign="top">Out of all the dream entries I''ve seen thus far, this one actually makes me feel like I am in a dream.  Beautiful, innocent, and magical.  Well done!</td>', 'Out of all the dream entries I''ve seen thus far, this one actually makes me feel like I am in a dream.  Beautiful, innocent, and magical.  Well done!', '2007-07-17 08:46:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(3910036, 551953, 43869, '<td valign="top">I like the idea and the lights,  but the bg is rather distracting</td>', 'I like the idea and the lights,  but the bg is rather distracting', '2007-07-17 08:48:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(3910037, 551982, 43869, '<td valign="top">nothing is in focuse and the bg is distracting.   I like the idea, just needs some work.</td>', 'nothing is in focuse and the bg is distracting.   I like the idea, just needs some work.', '2007-07-17 08:51:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(3910038, 552102, 43869, '<td valign="top">The color and clarity here is just beautiful!   Well done!</td>', 'The color and clarity here is just beautiful!   Well done!', '2007-07-17 08:52:58.000000', NULL, 1),
