(3910058, 552972, 43869, '<td valign="top">The powerlines ruin this for me.  The color in the sky and the clouds are beautiful.</td>', 'The powerlines ruin this for me.  The color in the sky and the clouds are beautiful.', '2007-07-17 09:09:38.000000', NULL, 1),
