(3911218, 551611, 19746, '<td valign="top">This is a good exercise in colour and I feel the layering of said colours invoke some sort of dreamlike quality.  <br/> <br/>It''s a pity about the compartmentalization of the window, it''s sure to detract from what would otherwise be a very compelling and powerful shot (that is, if it wasn''t immediately obvious that one was looking at the reflection in a sliding glass door).<br/> <br/>Perhaps a little crazy on the saturation, too?  A more interesting perspective would have been more pleasing too.<br/> <br/>6 From me, best of luck</td>', 'This is a good exercise in colour and I feel the layering of said colours invoke some sort of dreamlike quality.   It''s a pity about the compartmentalization of the window, it''s sure to detract from what would otherwise be a very compelling and powerful shot (that is, if it wasn''t immediately obvious that one was looking at the reflection in a sliding glass door). Perhaps a little crazy on the saturation, too?  A more interesting perspective would have been more pleasing too. 6 From me, best of luck', '2007-07-17 17:58:48.000000', NULL, 1),
