(3912196, 552977, 53316, '<td valign="top">re: wrinkles - <br/>I originally voted a 9, and it would have been 10 if not for the wrinkles.  But at the last minute I bumped it to a 10 because I realized that the wrinkles made it look more "real"...<br/>Wrinkles on a portrait backdrop are bad, because the attention isn''t supposed to be on the backdrop.. but I think in this case it looks more like a real bed, and it made me think of an ordinarry little girl who just happens to be asleep dreaming, and the wings and dress came about in her dream.  Awesome. :-)</td>', 're: wrinkles - I originally voted a 9, and it would have been 10 if not for the wrinkles.  But at the last minute I bumped it to a 10 because I realized that the wrinkles made it look more "real"...Wrinkles on a portrait backdrop are bad, because the attention isn''t supposed to be on the backdrop.. but I think in this case it looks more like a real bed, and it made me think of an ordinarry little girl who just happens to be asleep dreaming, and the wings and dress came about in her dream.  Awesome. :-)', '2007-07-18 01:04:05.000000', NULL, 0),
