(3913327, 551573, 5034, '<td valign="top">Scary dream man, especially with the teeth and eyes. I think the lighting on the fence is very harsh but I like the detail in the cat itself - it''s a stuffed one, right? - and I think the effect you''ve got is effective in drawing attention to the cat, not anywhere else.  Really dislike the lighting on the fence and under the cat though.  Good DOF.  I''d have given this one a 5.</td>', 'Scary dream man, especially with the teeth and eyes. I think the lighting on the fence is very harsh but I like the detail in the cat itself - it''s a stuffed one, right? - and I think the effect you''ve got is effective in drawing attention to the cat, not anywhere else.  Really dislike the lighting on the fence and under the cat though.  Good DOF.  I''d have given this one a 5.', '2007-07-18 07:10:05.000000', NULL, 0),
(3913359, 551573, 47316, '<td valign="top">I''m actually suprised this did as well as it did considering how many people must have thought it was in the wrong challenge. It is interesting what he''s doing... biting the fence, nose all pressed up against it. But as a photo, I dunno. I don''t think it''s a portfolio piece. The  quality isn''t the best, parts are blown out, and the angle and cropping is a bit weird. Would have been a lot better if you could see right into his eyes.</td>', 'I''m actually suprised this did as well as it did considering how many people must have thought it was in the wrong challenge. It is interesting what he''s doing... biting the fence, nose all pressed up against it. But as a photo, I dunno. I don''t think it''s a portfolio piece. The  quality isn''t the best, parts are blown out, and the angle and cropping is a bit weird. Would have been a lot better if you could see right into his eyes.', '2007-07-18 07:23:44.000000', NULL, 0),
