(3916914, 550342, 48228, '<td valign="top">I just keep coming back to this image to view it again and again.....<br/>I really do love what you have created here, as it is so appealing and very moving to me. It touches everyone of my senses..... I must add it to me favorites right now..... Awesome Crystal.....Totallt awesome.<br/> <br/>Almost fairylandish, and would be a great page out of a childrens story..... Maybe you should think about that, and write a childrens story about your daughter, with these style of images, to go with it..... I definately buy it.....<br/> <br/><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by sherpet:</b></div><hr/><i> Totallyy wonderful and so so dreamlike and so deserved the <b>"Blue" </b>ribbon..... </i></td></tr></table><br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2007-07-18 22:50:12.</i></td>', 'I just keep coming back to this image to view it again and again.....I really do love what you have created here, as it is so appealing and very moving to me. It touches everyone of my senses..... I must add it to me favorites right now..... Awesome Crystal.....Totallt awesome. Almost fairylandish, and would be a great page out of a childrens story..... Maybe you should think about that, and write a childrens story about your daughter, with these style of images, to go with it..... I definately buy it..... Originally posted by sherpet: Totallyy wonderful and so so dreamlike and so deserved the "Blue" ribbon..... ', '2007-07-18 23:46:11.000000', '2007-07-18 23:50:12.000000', 0),
