(3917801, 552038, 48471, '<td valign="top">Thanks for the visit and the comments and the votes. I''m surprised, I expected this to do worse, maybe struggle between 3 and 4, but never to be 5+.<br/> <br/>Anyhow, now I know what to do for Dreams III; I''ll make sure that there are a pair of legs there, in a funny angle, no face, no torso, just a pair of legs with funny cowboy boots.<br/> <br/>Thanks again.</td>', 'Thanks for the visit and the comments and the votes. I''m surprised, I expected this to do worse, maybe struggle between 3 and 4, but never to be 5+. Anyhow, now I know what to do for Dreams III; I''ll make sure that there are a pair of legs there, in a funny angle, no face, no torso, just a pair of legs with funny cowboy boots. Thanks again.', '2007-07-19 09:52:57.000000', NULL, 0),
(3917815, 552836, 56797, '<td valign="top">Beautiful shot. Someone thought this was my shot during voting and I''m so honored by that. Fantastic image. I love it and it does kind of look like my daughter is the model which is weird. Wonderful.</td>', 'Beautiful shot. Someone thought this was my shot during voting and I''m so honored by that. Fantastic image. I love it and it does kind of look like my daughter is the model which is weird. Wonderful.', '2007-07-19 09:57:16.000000', NULL, 0),
