(3918510, 551820, 72581, '<td valign="top">This is SOOOOOOOOOOOOOOO cute! I have a white cat that is basiclly identicle to yours except she has long hair. I love kitties and I really do wonder what it would be like is <i>we</i> were the pets. If I rated this picture it would have gotten a 10! One of my favorites.</td>', 'This is SOOOOOOOOOOOOOOO cute! I have a white cat that is basiclly identicle to yours except she has long hair. I love kitties and I really do wonder what it would be like is we were the pets. If I rated this picture it would have gotten a 10! One of my favorites.', '2007-07-19 13:55:38.000000', NULL, 0),
