(3923026, 552245, 55482, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by scalvert:</b></div><hr/><i> <table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by Alley Cat:</b></div><hr/><i>Its not from burning...</i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>If you can explain how it got there, then the SC would be more than willing to reconsider the DQ. Your original had no corresponding detail in that area of the sky. </i></td></tr></table> <br/>It''s from Clarify in the brightness/contrast mode</td>', 'Originally posted by scalvert: Originally posted by Alley Cat:Its not from burning...  If you can explain how it got there, then the SC would be more than willing to reconsider the DQ. Your original had no corresponding detail in that area of the sky.  It''s from Clarify in the brightness/contrast mode', '2007-07-20 22:41:42.000000', NULL, 0),
